## Vendor code is not included

The analysis observed the publicly served report page. Vendor code, capture
records, images, fonts and HAR are kept only in `evidence/private/`, which is
gitignored, and are not distributed here.

The decoder is an independent implementation of the observed format. It does
not include or require vendor code.

## Label strings

`src/locales.js` contains short functional UI labels observed in the public
page (`EFB`, `GOOD BATTERY`, `NORMAL`, `Car`, and their captured translations).
They are reproduced only so that an encoded label can be read back faithfully.
They are not an original translation work. Their provenance and capture date
are recorded in the file header and in `INVESTIGATION.md`.

## Optional `u` parameter

The optional `u` parameter is opaque website state (a display date). It is not
part of the QR payload, and this decoder does not decode it.

